{
  "_meta": {
    "artifact": "SCP-G5-B-01 — Freshline Tenant / Market / Catalogue / Policy Configuration v1.1",
    "purpose": "Expresses Freshline Bali's accepted behavior entirely as governed SCP configuration. Every value here is tenant configuration, not reusable Core logic: no file under src/core, src/kernel or src/lifecycle reads this bundle.",
    "ccSuppliedValues": [
      "planes.CATALOGUE.services[].durationMinutes — NOT present in the accepted-behavior freeze. SCP exclusive-capacity semantics cannot function without a duration, and the G5-B contract directs that service duration defaults be resolved here (G5A-G09). These are engineering defaults chosen to be internally consistent with the price ladder, NOT confirmed business facts, and MUST be confirmed by a human before Freshline transacts against them.",
      "planes.CATALOGUE.extras[].extraDurationMinutes — same status and same caveat.",
      "planes.CATALOGUE.*.active — the freeze requires active/inactive state to be configurable but did not state values; all catalogue items are set active, matching current Freshline operation.",
      "planes.MARKET.supportedLocales / localeDefault — normalized to the freeze's 'en' default with 'id' supported."
    ],
    "notCarriedForward": [
      "Bali geography, operating hours, currency, locale and brand values are deliberately NOT expressed as Core constants. The Core market plane (config/bali.market.json) remains the Core-facing configuration; this bundle is the tenant-facing governed configuration and does not modify it."
    ]
  },

